{"version":1,"key":"card:508","content":{"id":508,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"小白鼠试毒问题。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2b474a10-c4a6-4d60-b57c-2565c55f082e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"问题：现在有 1000 瓶药水，其中有 1 瓶毒药，毒药药性发作致死时间为 1 小时。现在有 1 个小时的时间找出毒药，那么至少需要多少只小白鼠来试毒？假设药水量无限，可以无限稀释，喝药时间不计。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a8a2151c-3c40-45d2-8783-49ed6892714d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"使用十位二进制对 1000 瓶药水进行编号：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f717e767-1b94-413f-ab62-65858ac8525f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"第一瓶药水编码为 0000000001","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e6239fb9-fdd6-4f30-82a1-89203c876d38","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"de37db67-c33e-4a74-b768-8789e57e3e4a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"...","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6b07d204-1eaa-4e9e-94b2-f107efff0f2f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"93f20be1-3171-4c83-8ef7-326a6d4adf41","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"第一千瓶药水编码为 1111101000","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d4921291-baae-49d8-b991-389762f46699","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f0da958d-a781-4356-97e8-dac527a6da84","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"1cf795ab-0ea4-4ded-94c6-8e060e64a436","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"接着取每个位置编码为 1 的药水分别混合为一瓶药水，十位二进制就混合为十瓶药水，每瓶药水都使用一只老鼠进行试验，如果对应的老鼠死了，说明包含毒药，就说明毒药在该二进制位是 1，进而可以知道毒药瓶的二进制表示，从而知道哪瓶是毒药。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"84085e2c-a4be-4ba2-8436-f883e4f8b0df","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"参考：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e1d1dadc-27bd-47ff-a8c8-c8646d317b53","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"小白鼠试毒问题","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e6631c2e-8116-4866-ad55-5a5c87dc16c0","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://fe.ecool.fun/topic/65d6d0c8-c15e-43d2-9e94-4fb86284fbd0"}],"collabId":"16241125-4f78-4e04-88b9-fe339c541f2a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"60aa9a40-8deb-4517-9d87-0d355a0bb402","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"5a062635-d425-4267-9ca3-64b9cd15565f","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["智力题","面试题"],"createTime":1730027245624,"updateTime":1793532526950,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532526950}}